# Project Specification: Airbnb Clone Task

## Target Reference URL

- Reference Target: `https://airbnb-clone-umber-two.vercel.app`
  Do not use any other github reference or any other websites for reference. The only allowed reference for this project is the given reference target which is `https://airbnb-clone-umber-two.vercel.app`
- Scope: Desktop view only (Ignore mobile responsive layouts entirely).

## Key Core Views to Implement

1. **Listing Page Component:**
   - Standard navigation bar (Header search bar mockup, user profile dropdown mockup).
   - Title & Quick Info bar (Rating, review count, location share/save links).
   - Main Photo Mosaic Grid: 1 large hero photo on left, 2x2 smaller stacked grid on right.
   - Floating Sticky Widget: Price calculation container.
   - Text Blocks: Host info, descriptions, feature grids, list layout for Reviews.

2. **Photo Tour Component:**
   - Triggers when clicking "Show all photos" button on the Main Grid or any of the Mosaic Grid photos.
   - Full screen, white background scrollable overlay.
   - Clean column list of all project property images.
   - Sticky context sub-header with property short details.

3. **Lightbox Component:**
   - Triggers when clicking _any_ individual photo inside the Photo Tour layout.
   - Center aligned active single image viewport.
   - Exact focus controls: Left/Right navigational buttons, index counter (e.g., 3 / 20).
   - Must handle Esc key event loops gracefully without blowing out memory stacks.

## Animation & Micro-interaction Bounds

- All overlay models must slide in smoothly using Framer Motion (`y: 100` to `y: 0` or subtle scale steps).
- Main Grid photos must use a slight image zoom scale on hover (`scale-105` inside an `overflow-hidden` container) with a subtle darken overlay.
- Interactive action items (buttons, icons, share clicks) must apply immediate focus indicator borders matching standard Airbnb layout behaviors.

## Asset Configuration Specs

- Mock local images inside an `@assets` folder using standard royalty-free landscape mock data if direct reference scraping is locked out.
- Do not add random extra properties, items, comments, or test boilerplate. Keep the codebase clean and ready for production submission.

## Delivery

- Submitted a zip file of the whole codebase and a @prompt-log.mdc file which contains all the logs of the prompts used.
- No git repository initialization or pushing code to git.

## Major constraint

Any direct lift and shift of the codebase from the reference url in @requirements.mdc could result in lower score or disqualification.

No plagiarized content.
